<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8523"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ztargate<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ztargate<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 10:29 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->LMAO <BR> <BR>I see that&#39;s a NAY. <BR>:| <BR> <BR>p.s. <BR>Would surprise you that Brian is the creator of the thomas-kilmann webpage that we all visit while checking the thomas killman connection? <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.teamtrainingsolutions.com/tki.html?source=Google" target=_top>http://www.teamtrainingsolutions.com/tki.html?sour ce=Google</a> <BR> <BR><IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0><!--/Text--></td></tr>
