<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8526"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ztargate<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ztargate<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 10:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Check the pictures section..... compare with the sketches we have.. then their history, then the persons backgrounds... see how many years one of them was out of the country. <BR> <BR>Gangs are like wolfpacks, they can&#39;t do a thing unless they are all together. <BR> <BR><IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0> A long shot, but... hey! <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
